Copyright 2026 Stephen Masters, Yvette Mankerian

This product re-exports the recognition network architecture of EasyOCR
(https://github.com/JaidedAI/EasyOCR, Apache License 2.0, JaidedAI).

Trained weights distributed with this project's releases are produced by
tetrak-hy-trainer (https://github.com/scattercode/tetrak-hy-trainer) and
are trained in part on text from Armenian Wikisource's edition of the
Armenian Soviet Encyclopedia (https://hy.wikisource.org/, CC BY-SA 3.0);
per-release attribution and provenance accompany each release.
